       "text": "* **Agency Pro (SaaS Mode):** $497/month (~$414/month billed annually) \u2014 allows you to fully white-label and resell the CRM as software to your clients"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       2,
       0
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 1118,
       "end_index": 1258,
       "text": "* **Watch out for:** The user interface can feel clunky, and there are additional pay-as-you-go costs for SMS, phone numbers, and AI credits"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       4
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 1714,
       "end_index": 1762,
       "text": "* **Pricing (billed annually, 3-seat minimum):**"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       4
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 1714,
       "end_index": 1820,
       "text": "* **Pricing (billed annually, 3-seat minimum):**\n  * **Basic:** ~$12 per user/month (lead/deal management)"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       4
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 1824,
       "end_index": 1911,
       "text": "* **Standard:** ~$17 per user/month (two-way email sync, custom templates, automations)"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       4
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 1915,
       "end_index": 1994,
       "text": "* **Pro:** ~$28 per user/month (sales forecasting, email tracking, mass emails)"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       5,
       4
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 1996,
       "end_index": 2095,
       "text": "* **Watch out for:** Has a strict 3-user minimum, so solopreneur agencies still pay for three seats"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       6,
       7
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 2110,
       "end_index": 2260,
       "text": "Best for Pure Inbound Marketing & Brand Authority: **HubSpot**\nHubSpot offers an intuitive interface, deep integrations, and top-tier contact tracking"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       6,
       8
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 2363,
       "end_index": 2485,
       "text": "* **Why it fits agencies:** Its free tier is one of the most generous on the market for pure contact and pipeline tracking"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       7,
       8
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 2487,
       "end_index": 2595,
       "text": "* **Pricing:**\n  * **Free Tools:** $0 (contact records, deal pipelines, form capture, basic email marketing)"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       7,
       9,
       8
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 2599,
       "end_index": 2737,
       "text": "* **Starter Customer Platform:** Starts at ~$15\u2013$20/seat/month (removes HubSpot branding, adds simple email automation and lead routing)"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       10,
       7,
       8
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 2741,
       "end_index": 2840,
       "text": "* **Professional Tiers:** Jumps to ~$800\u2013$890/month base (plus mandatory ~$3,000 onboarding fees)"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       8
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 2842,
       "end_index": 2891,
       "text": "* **Watch out for:** The infamous \"pricing cliff\""
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       7,
       8
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 2893,
       "end_index": 3022,
       "text": "It is very affordable at the Free/Starter level, but scaling into HubSpot Pro can be cost-prohibitive for a small boutique agency"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       11,
       12
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 3037,
       "end_index": 3263,
       "text": "Best for Simple, High-Ticket Sales Pipelines: **Pipedrive**\nIf your agency sells custom, high-ticket retainer contracts and you just need reps (or the founder) to stay on top of follow-ups, Pipedrive is simple and clutter-free"
      }
     },
     {
      "grounding_chunk_indices": [
       11
      ],
      "segment": {
       "start_index": 3434,
       "end_index": 3466,
       "text": "* **Pricing (billed annually):**"
